//!     the same contract): a LET-bound FVar zeta-reduces by SUBSTITUTING ITS
//!     CONTEXT VALUE AND CONTINUING; a non-let or missing FVar is STUCK,
//!     returned as-is.
//!   * def_eq's proof-irrelevance consult (tc/def_eq/mod.rs:358-367, only
//!     Some(true) short-circuits) with the FULL production helper chain from
//!     tc/def_eq/proof_irrel.rs — incl. THE NAMED LINE :147 (the FVar TYPE
//!     from the context), the type_is_quickly_not_in_prop pre-filter, the
//!     is_prop type-of-type check, and the infer_only=true FULL-inference
//!     fallback (tc/infer.rs:193-198) running on the SHARED context.
