    //   [C-guard] freshness assert! conditions → guard_trips counter (R8,
    //       unchanged; 0 on every path this round — no armed collision probe).
    //   [C-cache2] NEW: the tc consults whnf_cache/whnf_core_cache/def_eq_cache/
